#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/phy/equalizer.py:7
msgid "TXS-10002-2025 均衡器: ZF / MMSE 频域与时域均衡。"
msgstr ""
"TXS-10002-2025 equalizer: ZF / MMSE frequency-domain and time-domain "
"equalization."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/phy/equalizer.py:9
msgid "对于 SparkLink SLE 的 PSK 调制 (帧类型 2-4),接收端需要 信道均衡来对抗多径衰落引起的符号间干扰 (ISI)。"
msgstr ""
"For SparkLink SLE PSK modulation (frame types 2-4), the receiver requires"
" channel equalization to combat inter-symbol interference (ISI) caused by"
" multipath fading."

